[2026-03-14T22:40:44.188Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013XRybfGAGXnmP3559tYesc","type":"tool_result","content":"  1810→- **Action**: User creates a new project \"API v3\" via the create project modal\n  1811→- **Expected**: The project list now shows 3 projects, including the newly created \"API v3\". The new project appears without requiring a page refresh.\n  1812→\n  1813→#### Test: Create project modal Lead selector can be used multiple times\n  1814→- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, create project modal is open\n  1815→- **Action**: User selects \"Alice\" as lead, then clicks the lead selector again and changes to \"Bob\"\n  1816→- **Expected**: The lead is updated to \"Bob\". The selector works correctly on repeated use. Only one lead can be selected at a time.\n  1817→\n  1818→#### Test: Create project modal Teams selector can be toggled multiple times\n  1819→- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, create project modal is open\n  1820→- **Action**: User selects \"Engineering\", then also selects \"Design\", then deselects \"Engineering\"\n  1821→- **Expected**: Only \"Design\" remains selected. The multi-select works correctly through multiple toggle interactions.\n  1822→\n  1823→## Project Detail Page (`/project/:projectId`)\n  1824→\n  1825→**Components**: ProjectHeader, ProjectIssuesTab, ProjectOverviewTab\n  1826→\n  1827→### ProjectHeader\n  1828→\n  1829→#### Test: Project header renders all fields for an existing project\n  1830→- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, viewing `/project/1`. Project \"Auth Rewrite\" exists with status \"In Progress\", lead \"Jane Doe\", target date 2026-04-15, and 10 issues (6 completed).\n  1831→- **Expected**: The header displays the project name \"Auth Rewrite\" as an inline-editable text field. A status badge shows \"In Progress\" with appropriate styling. A progress bar shows 60% completion (6/10 issues). The target date \"Apr 15, 2026\" is displayed and inline-editable. The lead shows \"Jane Doe\" with avatar and is inline-editable.\n  1832→\n  1833→#### Test: Inline edit project name\n  1834→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`. Project name is \"Auth Rewrite\".\n  1835→- **Action**: User clicks on the project name text, clears it, types \"Auth Rewrite v2\", and presses Enter or clicks away to confirm.\n  1836→- **Expected**: The project name updates to \"Auth Rewrite v2\". The change is persisted to the database. An activity entry is created recording the name change.\n  1837→\n  1838→#### Test: Inline edit project name — cancel edit\n  1839→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`. Project name is \"Auth Rewrite\"."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BLv4Wge7RFx49s6dWZ72ER","session_id":"59439265-0bb7-4237-927c-cb18dbaeb3c9","uuid":"93ee77b2-525d-4c66-af9b-02d60aa5d7b0"}
