[2026-03-14T22:41:01.901Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BLv4Wge7RFx49s6dWZ72ER","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile a comprehensive report.\n\n## Summary\n\nI have successfully located and analyzed the Linear clone app and its related test files. Here are the findings:\n\n### **App Location**\n**Base directory**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone`\n\nThis is the only app in the `/repo/apps/` directory. It's a project management application inspired by Linear, designed for software development teams.\n\n### **1. Test Documentation File**\n**Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n\nThis file contains comprehensive test specifications (198,311 bytes). The two specific test entries you requested are located at:\n- Line 1813-1816: **\"Create project modal Lead selector can be used multiple times\"**\n  - Initial state: User is authenticated, create project modal is open\n  - Action: User selects \"Alice\" as lead, then clicks the lead selector again and changes to \"Bob\"\n  - Expected: The lead is updated to \"Bob\". The selector works correctly on repeated use. Only one lead can be selected at a time.\n\n- Line 1818-1821: **\"Create project modal Teams selector can be toggled multiple times\"**\n  - Initial state: User is authenticated, create project modal is open\n  - Action: User selects \"Engineering\", then also selects \"Design\", then deselects \"Engineering\"\n  - Expected: Only \"Design\" remains selected. The multi-select works correctly through multiple toggle interactions.\n\n### **2. Playwright Configuration**\n**Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nConfiguration details:\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n- Uses ReplayIO for recording\n- Fully parallel execution enabled\n- Reporter: ReplayIO (no upload), JSON, and HTML